---
import { url } from '../lib/data';
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-grid">
    <section class="brand-block">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <span class="brand-cn">紅海釣具</span>
        <span class="brand-en">FishTool.tw</span>
      </div>
      <p class="brand-desc">磯釣、灘釣、船釣、釣蝦、路亞——多元釣具一站精選。<br />中壢實體門市與線上同步出貨。</p>
      <div class="social-row">
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/809912915726639/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="加入 Facebook 社團" title="中壢紅海釣具粉絲團">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12a10 10 0 1 0-11.6 9.88V14.9H7.9V12h2.5V9.8c0-2.5 1.5-3.9 3.8-3.9 1.1 0 2.2.2 2.2.2v2.5h-1.3c-1.2 0-1.6.8-1.6 1.6V12H16l-.4 2.9h-2.2v6.98A10 10 0 0 0 22 12Z"/></svg>
